At first you will be able to get only one '''Goose''' [[File:Goose.png|frameless|21x21px]]. Once you can get more, proceed to evolve 3 '''Lizards''' into '''Crocodiles''' [[File:Crocodile.png|frameless|35x35px]]. These two evolutions will boost your Coin production so quickly that you will be able to evolve all your '''Gobbos''' into '''Lizardmen'''[[File:Lizardman.png|frameless|27x27px]] (Lv50), and this will lead you into evolving your '''Horn Hippo'''[[File:Horn Hippo.png|frameless|35x35px]] into a '''Rainboppo'''[[File:Rainboppo.png|frameless|35x35px]](Lv200), and your '''Beeg Hippo''' [[File:Beeg Hippo.png|frameless|35x35px]] into a '''Chonkoppo'''[[File:Chonkoppo.png|frameless|35x35px]] (Lv200).

Since you reached '''Realm Lv20,''' there's no more need for Realm EXP anymore, so you should change the '''Orb Tower's trait''' for a money oriented one. These traits have less than 1% chance, so settle for the <u>first one</u> you can get. <u>Much later on</u> you can save up '''<u>15.000 - 20.000 Energy</u>''' to get '''Gold Bless  [[File:Trait39.png|frameless|26x26px]]'''. Remember you need at least one Minion with the trait before rolling for it. The priority of the traits will be as follows:

# '''Gold Bless''' [[File:Trait39.png|frameless|32x32px]] from [[File:Goose.png|frameless|31x31px]] - Increases all coin gain by +250% per blessing you have the most of  (Babby Egg -> Lil Chicken -> Goose)
# '''Smart Money''' [[File:Trait31.png|frameless|32x32px]] from [[File:Babby Egg.png|frameless|32x32px]] - Increases all coin gain by +40% per 5 Realm Lv (Babby Egg)
# '''Make It Rain''' [[File:Trait8.png|frameless|30x30px]] from [[File:Volcano.png|frameless|35x35px]] - Increases all coin gain by +150% from all sources (Pet Rock -> Mountain -> Volcano)

==== Vending Machine must-have goodies ====
When you reach the point of having '''Goose''' [[File:Goose.png|frameless|21x21px]] and '''Lizardmen'''[[File:Lizardman.png|frameless|27x27px]] at the same time on your team, go back to the Vending Machine and buy every latest new upgrade you can, and do so until you can't go further. You should be generating enough Coins to buy up to '''Bagged Pancakes'''[[File:VendingItem13.png|frameless|28x28px]] '''(BP).''' From now on, whenever you have spare Coins to spend at the Vending Machine, upgrade all of the following:

* '''Wheat Chew[[File:VendingItem0.png|frameless|28x28px]]'''
* '''Choccy Coin'''[[File:VendingItem3.png|frameless|28x28px]]
* '''Tuna Can'''[[File:VendingItem6.png|frameless|28x28px]]: retrigger away time
* '''Corn Can'''[[File:VendingItem9.png|frameless|28x28px]]: increase away gains
* '''Icecream Sammich'''[[File:VendingItem10.png|frameless|28x28px]]: start with Coins after resetting
* '''Bagged Pancakes'''[[File:VendingItem13.png|frameless|28x28px]] '''(BP)''': unstackable traits now stack. Later on, Minion amount might be refered at "'''BP+2'''", with '''BP''' being your Bagged Pancakes bonus.
* '''Iced Footlong'''[[File:VendingItem14.png|frameless|28x28px]]: Minion damage multiplier based on Ice Creams (this one might not be available yet)

These Vending Machine upgrades will boost your Realm progression <u>a lot</u>, and you should be buying them everytime you can after upgrading your Minions from here on. Be wary of '''Vendi Bar'''[[File:VendingItem12.png|frameless|28x28px]](explained on [[Realm#WARNING|Warning]]). Since you have '''Tuna Can'''[[File:VendingItem6.png|frameless|28x28px]] and '''Corn Can'''[[File:VendingItem9.png|frameless|28x28px]], you should leave Realm screen everytime you want to idle, so you have a chance to retrigger away time for a huge progression boost.

==== Approaching Stage 23 ====
Once you reach '''Stage 23''' you need to deal Purple Damage. This is done by acquiring a '''Rainboppo''' [[File:Rainboppo.png|frameless|35x35px]] (Little Piggy -> Hippo -> Horn Hippo -> Rainboppo). Now when you banish Minions they will deal Purple damage equal to the amount of Realm EXP. Given Purple Health bar is based on your Realm EXP, you should always banish the minimum amount required to take down the health bar (explained on [[Realm#WARNING|Warning]]). From here on, do not get any Realm EXP increase at all (from Blessings or Orb Tower).

At this point, you can decide to keep doing the Reset Loop, or continue to '''Stage 25.''' It's advised to carry on, since unlocking the Field will change the gameplay a lot, exponentially increasing the amounts of Spirals earned by reset (up to the point of doing only one reset to cap every Shrine Upgrade!).

=== Stage 25-49 ===
Congrats! You have learned all the basic elements of Realm. And you also made it through the slowest and most idle part! Now it's time for <u>'''really'''</u> active gameplay.

Once you reach Stage 25, the [[Realm#Field|Field]] will be available on the left side. Its currency are '''Flowers''', which are generated by '''Ogre Spawns''' [[File:Ogre Spawn.png|frameless|25x25px]]. Every single Plot is useful and will provide great benefits eventually. For now, we will care about the mentioned below. Plot 6, 7 and 8 are too expensive at this point to be helpful, and Plot 2 might be controversial because Coin/Damage reduction (explained on [[Realm#WARNING|Warning]]). Given all the '''Lizardmen'''[[File:Lizardman.png|frameless|27x27px]] present in your composition, upgrading the Plots below throughout the normal Realm loop should be fairly easy.

* '''<u>Plot 1:</u>'''  <u>'''Full Blossom'''</u> - each Ogre Spawn generates more Flowers. Immediately focus on this one, and keep upgrading whenever is the least expensive option.
* Plot 3: Juiced Fruit - Fruits effect are stronger. Very cheap, should be maxed fairly easy.
* Plot 4: Cash Genesis - Minions have a chance to produce x2 Coins. Quite cheap and really helpful.
* '''<u>Plot 5</u>:''' <u>'''Spare Charge'''</u> - '''<u>every Minion</u>''' now generates Energy. This effect will be the base on which you will build your Orb Tower.

==== Vending Machine purchase loop ====
Now you should be in an <u>'''Vending''' '''Machine purchase loop'''</u>: you keep leveling your '''Chonkoppo''' [[File:Chonkoppo.png|frameless|35x35px]] for more base Coin production, keep pushing '''Stages''' for a stronger '''Choccy Coin'''[[File:VendingItem3.png|frameless|28x28px]], keep buying all the previously mentioned '''[[Realm#Vending Machine must-have goodies|Vending Machine must-have goodies]]''', and keep claiming the "'''Get 100 Coins currency" trophies'''. This combination will eventually catapult you into being able to mutate your '''3 Crocodiles''' [[File:Crocodile.png|frameless|35x35px]] into  '''Crikeydiles''' [[File:Crikeydile.png|frameless|35x35px]] (Lv200), which offer a total 90% cashback on every Realm purchase. Once that point is reached, new Minions will join the composition: 
