==== Having all Blessing leveled at once! ====
Since '''Dharma''' is maxed, now you have the possibility of having every single blessing and leveling them all at once. To acomplish this, pick one of every blessing marked with "pick" at the [[Realm#Blessings|blessings table]] until you have one of each. Reroll if needed to get a new blessing you didn't yet get. Once you have all the blessings you want, going forwad only pick '''One For All [[File:A Realm.png|frameless|25x25px]]''' blessing. Reroll without any worry since the three '''Musculors''' [[File:Musculor.png|frameless|46x46px]] give a 90% chance to not spend them, and the '''Purpbacks''' [[File:Purpback.png|frameless|48x48px]] give you more rerolls than you can spend. 

Once you reach '''Stage 47''' you need to deal White Damage. This is done by acquiring a '''Big Bone''' [[File:Big Bone.png|frameless|36x36px]] (Ogre Spawn -> Ogre -> Flesh Ogre -> Big Bone). Now every attack deals White Damage based on your outside-Realm damage. 

=== Stage 50 and beyond ===
Contratulations, you beat Realm! If you have been following the recommendations, by this point you should have:

