With all of this, you should keep pushing and reset once you get more than '''235T Spirals''' when resetting. This will allow you to max all the remaining '''Shrine Upgrades.''' If you don't have '''Torchy'''  [[File:Torchy.png|frameless|33x33px]] unlocked, you won't be able to push further than '''Afterlife 91,'''  which won't allow you to earn such amount of Spirals. If that's the case, you can reset with  '''5T Spirals''' to max every '''Shrine Upgrade''' besides '''Bhakti'''. 

From here on, you can keep pushing to keep upgrading your '''Vending Machine,''' and also reach '''Realm Lv400''' to boost the '''Nirvana Upgrade.''' Other than that, you are already finished with Realm!.
