==Vending Machine==
[[File:Vending Machine.png|thumb|The Vending Machine with all goodies unlocked]]
Unlocked after beating '''Afterlife 3'''. Its currency are Coins and dollar bills, the same used with Minions. Coins can be spent to buy goodies, which are permanent upgrades, both for Realm and outside-Realm features. New goodies are unlocked by buying one of the latest unlocked.

As of right now, the buttons on the right don't do anything.
